{"seq":1,"slug":"switches-logic-gates","title":"基因开关与逻辑门","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/synthetic-biology/circuits/switches-logic-gates","wordCount":1388,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"基因开关与逻辑门\">基因开关与逻辑门</h1><p>2000 年《自然》同期发表的两篇论文，被公认为合成生物学的「创世时刻」：一篇是 Gardner 和 Collins 做出的双稳态拨动开关，另一篇是后面要讲的振荡器。开关的意义在于，它第一次证明了人们可以在活细胞里实现一种本属于电子电路的行为——记忆。一个细胞能「记住」自己曾经被刺激过，哪怕刺激早已撤去。本篇讲清楚基因开关如何获得记忆、逻辑门如何用 DNA 实现，以及它们如何成为更复杂线路的积木。这些积木建立在 <a href=\"../foundations/standard-biological-parts\">标准化生物元件</a> 之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-双稳态与记忆\">核心概念：双稳态与记忆</h2><p>拨动开关（toggle switch）的核心是两个互相抑制的基因：基因 A 的产物抑制基因 B，基因 B 的产物抑制基因 A。这种「互锁」结构产生<strong>双稳态</strong>——系统有两个稳定状态（A 开 B 关，或 B 开 A 关），而中间态不稳定，系统会自动滑向其中一端。一旦进入某个状态，即使诱导信号撤除，状态也会维持，这就是记忆的分子基础。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;基因 A&lt;br/&gt;表达蛋白 a&quot;] --&gt;|抑制| B[&quot;基因 B&lt;br/&gt;表达蛋白 b&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|抑制| A&#10;    I1[&quot;诱导物 1&quot;] -.-&gt;|解除 a 的抑制| A&#10;    I2[&quot;诱导物 2&quot;] -.-&gt;|解除 b 的抑制| B&#10;    A --&gt; S1[&quot;状态一&lt;br/&gt;A 高 / B 低&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; S2[&quot;状态二&lt;br/&gt;B 高 / A 低&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"基因 A&lt;br/&gt;表达蛋白 a\"] --&gt;|抑制| B[\"基因 B&lt;br/&gt;表达蛋白 b\"]\n    B --&gt;|抑制| A\n    I1[\"诱导物 1\"] -.-&gt;|解除 a 的抑制| A\n    I2[\"诱导物 2\"] -.-&gt;|解除 b 的抑制| B\n    A --&gt; S1[\"状态一&lt;br/&gt;A 高 / B 低\"]\n    B --&gt; S2[\"状态二&lt;br/&gt;B 高 / A 低\"]</pre><p>双稳态能否出现，不是任意互抑都能保证的，它要求抑制足够「陡峭」。用一对对称的 Hill 型方程描述两个蛋白浓度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u, v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 的动态：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>α</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>v</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>α</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{du}{dt} = \\frac{\\alpha}{1+v^n} - u, \\qquad \\frac{dv}{dt} = \\frac{\\alpha}{1+u^n} - v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8769em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8769em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>只有当合成强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 足够大、协同系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（抑制有协同性）时，系统才会出现两个稳定不动点。这个判据告诉设计者：要做出可靠的开关，必须挑选抑制陡峭、强度足够的元件——这正是 <a href=\"../foundations/dbtl-cycle\">设计-构建-测试-学习循环</a> 中设计阶段要量化预测的目标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"逻辑门-用基因实现布尔运算\">逻辑门:用基因实现布尔运算</h2><p>如果说开关提供了记忆，逻辑门则提供了计算。把启动子看作「整合输入的处理器」，就能用基因表达实现布尔函数。下表列出几种基本门的生物实现思路。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>逻辑门</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出条件</th>\n<th>典型生物实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NOT（反相器）</td>\n<td>单输入</td>\n<td>输入低时输出高</td>\n<td>输入蛋白为抑制子，关闭下游启动子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AND</td>\n<td>双输入</td>\n<td>两者皆高才输出</td>\n<td>拆分蛋白互补，或双激活子串联启动子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OR</td>\n<td>双输入</td>\n<td>任一为高即输出</td>\n<td>两个独立启动子并联驱动同一基因</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NAND</td>\n<td>双输入</td>\n<td>非（两者皆高）</td>\n<td>AND 后接 NOT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NOR</td>\n<td>双输入</td>\n<td>两者皆低才输出</td>\n<td>OR 后接 NOT</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>AND 门的一种优雅实现是「拆分」策略：把一个激活蛋白拆成两半，分别由两个输入诱导表达，只有两半同时存在并重组成完整蛋白时，下游基因才被激活。这种设计的好处是天然正交、串扰小。逻辑门的层叠会带来信号失真累积的问题，如何用正交元件控制串扰，见 <a href=\"debugging-orthogonality\">线路调试与正交性</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"传递函数-门的-数字化-程度\">传递函数:门的「数字化」程度</h2><p>一个好的逻辑门必须接近「数字」行为：输入要么算高、要么算低，输出也应清晰地落在两档之一，中间的模糊地带越窄越好。刻画这种行为的是<strong>传递函数</strong>——输出对输入的稳态响应曲线。对一个反相器，传递函数常用 Hill 形式表达：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>K</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = y_{\\min} + \\frac{y_{\\max}-y_{\\min}}{1 + (x/K)^n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这里 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，曲线越陡，门就越「数字化」；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 是切换阈值，决定多大的输入才算「高」。设计者追求高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>（陡峭切换）和合适的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span>（阈值匹配下游），并要求一个门的输出动态范围能覆盖下游门的输入阈值——这叫<strong>阻抗匹配</strong>，是逻辑门能否级联的前提。门之间阈值不匹配，是复杂线路失效的常见原因，调试方法见 <a href=\"debugging-orthogonality\">线路调试与正交性</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从单门到组合电路-crispr-时代的逻辑\">从单门到组合电路:CRISPR 时代的逻辑</h2><p>把多个门级联，理论上可以实现任意复杂的布尔逻辑，但生物实现很快遇到两个墙：可用的正交抑制子数量有限，以及级联越深、信号失真和延迟越严重。2025 年的一个重要方向，是用 CRISPR 的可编程性来突破第一道墙——通过更换 guide RNA 就能生成大量互不串扰的「人造抑制子」，使逻辑门的扩展不再受限于天然转录因子的数量（CRISPR 使能逻辑线路的综述见近年文献）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    IN1[&quot;输入 A&lt;br/&gt;诱导物&quot;] --&gt; G1[&quot;NOT 门&lt;br/&gt;反相器&quot;]&#10;    IN2[&quot;输入 B&lt;br/&gt;诱导物&quot;] --&gt; G2[&quot;AND 门&lt;br/&gt;拆分激活子&quot;]&#10;    G1 --&gt; G2&#10;    G2 --&gt; OUT[&quot;输出&lt;br/&gt;报告基因 / 执行器&quot;]&#10;    G2 --&gt; MEM[&quot;拨动开关&lt;br/&gt;锁存结果&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    IN1[\"输入 A&lt;br/&gt;诱导物\"] --&gt; G1[\"NOT 门&lt;br/&gt;反相器\"]\n    IN2[\"输入 B&lt;br/&gt;诱导物\"] --&gt; G2[\"AND 门&lt;br/&gt;拆分激活子\"]\n    G1 --&gt; G2\n    G2 --&gt; OUT[\"输出&lt;br/&gt;报告基因 / 执行器\"]\n    G2 --&gt; MEM[\"拨动开关&lt;br/&gt;锁存结果\"]</pre><p>把计算门与记忆开关结合,就得到了「能算、能记」的生物线路雏形——这也是从静态逻辑走向动态行为（如振荡）的桥梁。CRISPR 作为可编程调控工具的更深入原理，见 <a href=\"../enabling-tech/crispr-editing\">基因编辑 CRISPR</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>拨动开关靠两个<strong>互相抑制</strong>的基因产生<strong>双稳态</strong>，从而获得记忆——撤去诱导后仍维持状态。</li>\n<li>双稳态的出现要求抑制陡峭（协同系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）且合成强度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 足够，这是元件选型的量化判据。</li>\n<li>逻辑门用启动子整合输入实现布尔运算：NOT 靠抑制子、AND 靠拆分蛋白、OR 靠并联启动子。</li>\n<li>门的「数字化」程度由<strong>传递函数</strong>的陡峭度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 与阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">K</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span></span></span></span></span> 决定，级联要求<strong>阻抗匹配</strong>。</li>\n<li>2025 年起 <strong>CRISPR</strong> 提供大量正交「人造抑制子」，突破了天然转录因子数量对逻辑扩展的限制。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"基因开关与逻辑门","id":"基因开关与逻辑门"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：双稳态与记忆","id":"核心概念-双稳态与记忆"},{"level":2,"text":"逻辑门:用基因实现布尔运算","id":"逻辑门-用基因实现布尔运算"},{"level":2,"text":"传递函数:门的「数字化」程度","id":"传递函数-门的-数字化-程度"},{"level":2,"text":"从单门到组合电路:CRISPR 时代的逻辑","id":"从单门到组合电路-crispr-时代的逻辑"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"设计-构建-测试-学习循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/synthetic-biology/foundations/dbtl-cycle"},"next":{"title":"振荡器与反馈线路","url":"/l-doc-books/h/biology-life-science/synthetic-biology/circuits/oscillators-feedback"}}